  "request": {
    "spec": "Consolidate all duplicate detection into a single derived 'identityKey' = normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' + householdId, and reject with 409 only when a new owner's WHOLE identityKey equals an existing owner's. This changes existing behaviour: the separate telephone, email and household duplicate checks must now be expressed through this one key. Because the telephone is part of the key, two members of the same household (same householdId) with different telephones have different identityKeys and must both be allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate. Return 'identityKey'.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nConsolidate all duplicate detection into a single derived 'identityKey' = normalizedTelephone + '|' + (email or empty) + '|' + householdId, and reject with 409 only when a new owner's WHOLE identityKey equals an existing owner's. This changes existing behaviour: the separate telephone, email and household duplicate checks must now be expressed through this one key. Because the telephone is part of the key, two members of the same household (same householdId) with different telephones have different identityKeys and must both be allowed; only an exact full-key match is a duplicate. Return 'identityKey'.\n"
  },
